"P2764782978" "The opportunity was there, things just didn't quite work out as well as you'd hoped. Still, the machine's tip was good, even though you don't know how that could be possible. Right now it's screen blinks with the words: <br><br>'Insert Coin to Play Again!'"
// RandomFameString :
"P1625074577" "I heard {VillainName} got tangled up in a battle between the Tsoo and Arachnos over some old swords and stuff."

