// Dialog :
"P330771472" "Those bearer bonds were quite a windfall, and considering the highly suspect activities going on, it's going to be unlikely that anyone will even say you were there. Once more the Slot Machine's clue was perfect. How it works is still a mystery, but you have the feeling that there may still be some more games to play with this particular one-armed bandit."
// RandomFameString :
"P3635530595" "Stealing from the Carnival of Shadows mid-heist! {VillainName} really ended that crime-spree with a bang!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3711909708" "This one didn't go as well as you'd planned, but at least there's little chance anyone there will even mention you were on the scene, considering how much trouble they're already in. Once more the Slot Machine's clue was perfect. How it works is still a mystery, but you have the feeling that there may still be some more games to play with this particular one-armed bandit."
// RandomFameString :
"P4016988345" "Looks like {VillainName}'s crime spree's come to an ignominious end. Some people never learn."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
